        {
          "text": " Naineratar ebe, “Ejai ainapakin ka aiyamakina,” eŋesakin do kes amudiar kwape eŋesakinor ariebo aberu naidouni, kwa bo mam ekuete nepepec da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
